    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> folkertdev created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14361#discussion_r4054029831\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think I got it. I'm swapping <code>v1, v0</code> so the body cannot be optimized out (even though it maybe wouldn't today).</p>\n</blockquote>",
